      "content": "i get that, but my doctor is always so rushed and basically just gives me a prescription and sends me out the door. i'd really rather try something holistic first if possible. i read online that it's mostly just used for mild stuff so maybe if i just take a small dose it won't mess with my blood thinners too much? like a low dose supplement?",
